OL,3,GNEWSAYouth Crime PCSO sentenced for
OL,4,Achild misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former youth crime police community
OL,7,Fsupport officer (PCSO) has been
OL,8,Fsentenced after an investigation found
OL,9,Fhe pursued an intimate relationship
OL,10,Fwith a child.
OL,12,FInvestigators said Keith Sayers, from
OL,13,FBorehamwood in Hertfordshire, regularly
OL,14,Fmet up with the child and kissed her
OL,15,Fwhen she was 16.
OL,17,FThe 43-year-old pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fmisconduct in public office and three
OL,19,Fcharges of unlawfully accessing police
OL,20,Fsystems.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
